<title>PERU: Peru says 1996 fishmeal output up 5.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Peru says 1996 fishmeal output up 5.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru produced 1.885 million tonnes of fishmeal in 1996, up 5.4 percent from the previous year's total of 1.789 million tonnes, the government said.</p>
<p>A Fisheries' Ministry report added that production in December was 322,800 tonnes, up from 150,100 tonnes in the same month last year.</p>
</text>
